@* SPEC: docs/00-COMPONENTS/2.8/01-LipiTable-Spec.md §3.2 (LipiColumn declaration) *@
@* PHASE: 2.8 Data Display — Stage 2 core shell *@
@* COMPONENT: LipiColumn<TItem, TValue> — declarative column; renders no DOM of its own. *@
@typeparam TItem
@typeparam TValue
@namespace LiPi.Components.DataDisplay

@* LipiColumn contributes a column definition to the parent LipiTable via RegisterColumn
   during OnInitialized. It renders nothing itself — the table reads the captured
   definition and renders header + cells. ChildContent is captured only so that
   <CellTemplate>/<HeaderTemplate>/<EditTemplate>/<FilterTemplate> markup parses; those
   are exposed as typed RenderFragment parameters in the code-behind. *@
